  "itemGroup.artifice": "Artifice",
  "jei.artifice.box": "Put up to 8 equal stacks into a crafting grid together with an empty box to pack them into one box. A filled box alone in the grid unpacks one stack (shift-click: the whole stack of boxes). Right-click unpacks one box, sneak right-click the whole stack; a dispenser unpacks too.",
  "jei.artifice.detector": "Emits a short redstone pulse whenever an adjacent block changes.",
  "jei.artifice.flowers": "Grows on grass with bone meal.",
  "jei.artifice.lotus": "Opens in the light and closes in the dark (light level below 8).",
  "jei.artifice.scaffolding": "Walk against scaffolding to climb it, sneak to hold on. Left-click with the same scaffolding to stack one on top. Scaffolding needs support below or a rooted scaffold of the same kind within its maximum overhang.",
  "jei.artifice.sickle": "Breaking leaves harvests all leaves within the radius; breaking a plant harvests all plants on the same level within the radius.",
  "jei.artifice.sledge": "Breaks these blocks into their parts (each part may be lost):",
  "jei.artifice.sledge.entry": "%s: %s",
  "jei.artifice.upgrade": "Craft a tool, weapon or armour piece together with upgrades: every upgrade raises its enchantment by one level, up to the level shown on the upgrade. Incompatible enchantments are refused.",
  "jei.artifice.upgrade_type": "Tool Upgrades",
